{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><u>The Barber Shop</u></strong>\u00a0\u2014 an incremental upgrade management simulator where every snip counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your humble, run-down barbershop is about to get a makeover. Invest your hard-earned coins, upgrade your gear, and transform your small-town shop into a sprawling golden parlor\u00a0worthy of the finest clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your barbers\u2019 skills, keep your customers happy, and deliver the stylish cuts they demand \u2014 all while balancing upgrades, marketing, and rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its charming pixel art and simple yet addictive gameplay loop, <u><strong>The Barber Shop</strong></u>\u00a0offers\u00a0 <strong>2+ hours</strong> of satisfying snips and strategic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade chairs, tools, and d\u00e9cor to boost your shop\u2019s comfort and appeal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your barbers for faster, better cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time, money, and customers to keep the business thriving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new stations and expand your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill pixel-art visuals with an easy-to-pick-up, hard-to-put-down style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn your tiny shop into the ultimate hair-cutting empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unlocked 3 Barbers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928270/d4e4648b78e2cf723da8b2e8e266864c68c51e39.jpg"},{"name":"Reached 100 Reputation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928270/ba5d28d4a23be0961869e73f16d1cf6611809fe4.jpg"},{"name":"Reached 1000 Reputation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/